# Copy to .env.network (ignored by Git); set this computer's reserved LAN IPv4.
# No public IP is required here. Port 8000 is configured in the service unit.
WINE_API_SOURCE_IP=
# Optional: bypass mark for a VPN with an inverted fwmark rule at priority 0/1.
# If omitted, install_api_network.sh detects it from the currently enabled VPN.
# WINE_API_VPN_BYPASS_MARK=0x...
